   "lines": [
    "Early in the morning,",
    "which was clear & cool,",
    "I had a magnificent",
    "twenty mile gallop",
    "with Emlen.",
    "Towards midday Emlen,",
    "West, Jack & I",
    "started off on the",
    "Addie for a",
    "short yachting",
    "cruise; Emlen leaves",
    "us early tomorrow",
    "morning. The",
    "wind was light",
    "and we made",
    "New Haven about",
    "10 p.m."
   ],
